{
  "slug": "rtl-chat-fixer",
  "name": "Rtl Chat Fixer",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Fixes jumbled text when mixing RTL languages (Hebrew, Arabic, Persian, Urdu) with English in Cowork and Claude Desktop chat. Teaches Claude how to structure mixed-direction responses so they render cleanly using proper Unicode BiDi formatting.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `rtl-chat` (Ensures Claude's chat responses are properly formatted for RTL (right-to-left) text in Hebrew, Arabic, Persian (Farsi), Urdu, and…).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install rtl-chat-fixer@claude-community` from `MSApps-Mobile/claude-plugins` (`plugins/rtl-chat-fixer`).",
